fixture zone1_loop
doc The 60-second movement-only loop through zone 1 (the Immaculate Checklist): from room 01's west arrival with the Kindle Votive (option kindle 1), through all twelve rooms by their teaching routes (each room's route fixture, started on the tick after the previous room's door is crossed, so Ash arrives with the speed she left with) and out of room 12's east door back into room 01. 3584 ticks (59.7 s); per room: 359, 242, 344, 552, 412, 487, 161, 211, 214, 179, 247, 176. No hit is taken and no heart lost. Room 4 opens with 3 ticks of left, to give back the 11 u that the carried speed adds, and room 7 with 2 and room 11 with 1 (see docs/feel_log/2026-10-19-merge-zone1.md). Longer than the 600-frame guideline by design.
room zone1/01_dash_slash
spawn 74 832
option kindle 1
frames 3584
